I won't become Uma Kamen again!

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:13.180
Sanae.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.600
Are you sleeping with the lights on?

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.010
I'm awake.

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.770
Come to the front door right away.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.190
Momoko-dono is here to see you.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:22.750
Eh?

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.110
Inuzuka-kun haven't returned?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.380
Yeah, and I thought you might know something.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:30.790
Why me?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.750
To tell you the truth, I thought to go home together with him.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:40.430
But it looked like he had something important to tell you, and then went home without me.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.440
That's...

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.820
It looks like the landlord is gone.

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:46.800
If she comes back, let's run right away.

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:50.070
We were just talking about some school work.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.350
We weren't really...

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:55.150
Senpai, leave this to me.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.730
Do you know where Koushi senpai is?

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.620
I'm sorry, I don't.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:01.900
Are you sure?

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:03.850
It's fishy.

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:05.920
Are you hiding something?

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.560
What did Koushi senpai talk to you about?

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:09.530
I got it.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:10.190
Huh?

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.920
Momoko senpai!

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.680
Sorry to have disturbed you.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:16.440
Anyways, I'm going to search for Koushi-dono.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:17.980
Me too...

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:22.440
Do... Don't leave me behind, sis!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.100
Inuzuka-kun...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.420
Places where Inuzuka-kun might go...

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:33.240
<i>Everyone says this shop is great.</i>

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.840
<i>It... It's not like I'm inviting you or something...</i>

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:42.500
He's not here...

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:47.300
I want to make this as soon as possible, the Shirasaki castle!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:50.760
He's not here either.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.220
Inuzuka-kun...

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.570
Where are you?

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:00.800
Yuuka-chan?

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:02.590
Class rep!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.380
What's wrong?

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:07.330
Inuzuka-kun is... Inuzuka-kun is...

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.400
What happened to Inuzuka-kun?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:13.830
A scary person dragged him into a car, and drove away.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.590
Can it be another assassin!?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.980
That man said he'll throw Inuzuka-kun into the sea.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.960
It's another assassination, unmistakable.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.410
I saw it by accident.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:26.420
But my legs were trembling and I couldn't do anything.

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.210
It's not Yuuka-chan's fault.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:30.380
It's not your fault.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:34.330
If you have any other clues, tell me.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:35.900
I want to save Inuzuka-kun.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.980
The car was a black sedan.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:45.380
Oh yeah, he said it's the Kouzu harbor, there are man-eating sea snakes appearing there recently.

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:46.670
"Recently"?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.180
"Man-eating sea snakes"?

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.310
They are from back then...

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.860
I'll contact the police.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:57.570
Momoko-chan and the others are also looking for Inuzuka-kun.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.420
Could you tell them everything?

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.370
OK, I got it.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:26.890
I have made up my mind.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.680
My personal image is nothing.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:32.150
I have to protect my Hikaru-kun...

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.170
The one I love...

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.710
Inuzuka-kun!

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.230
Unlucky kid.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:53.100
Shit.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.710
I should get going now.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:01.080
He's too weak.

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:02.460
He's not an assassin?

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:05.350
Inuzuka-kun is not here.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.510
Don't tell me he's already...

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.190
Inuzuka-kun!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.530
Inuzuka-kun...

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.000
There he is!

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:27.140
It's suffocating...

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.410
I can't hold on anymore...

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.020
I... Inuzuka-kun...

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.840
I can't lose to something like this...

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.040
I... I...

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:43.060
I'm the heroine of love and justice, who will save Inuzuka-kun.

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:44.940
Tenchuu warrior, Uma Kamen!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.710
Sandera Shingo style, ultimate technique.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:53.790
Translation: The crushing M-shaped legs of Pegasus.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:53.790
Nyoi Tenma M-ji Heikyaku

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.250
Inuzuka-kun!

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:04.090
Sorry to have made you wait.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:05.630
Inuzuka-kun...

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:16.900
I won't let Koushi senpai get killed by a nobody.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.850
Koushi-dono!

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:31.750
Oh no...

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.980
I... I'm saved?

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.550
Koushi-dono!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:37.370
I see.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.820
So she defeated him.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:41.480
Koushi-dono...

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:43.430
Koushi-dono, hang in there!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.660
You defeated him on your own, right?

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.350
I believed you could do it!

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:49.870
Koushi senpai is strong after all!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:06.250
Heroes fulfill their duties without other people knowing.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.850
Koushi-dono, does your head still hurt?

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.860
No, it felt all better after a night of sleep.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:18.220
I'm relieved.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:22.330
Thank goodness.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.310
Inuzuka-kun looks fine.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.350
Thank goodness...

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:28.640
This is fine...

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:29.990
This is...

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.820
I hate this after all!

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:35.420
Being a heroine without any recognition...

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:37.520
Hey, Sanae.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.600
It's all because grandma told me to do it!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:43.330
It looks like this is the worst time of all...

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.540
Sanae, I found you a good man.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.510
He'll be your fiancé.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.870
How can you make that decision on your own!?

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.030
He's here already, so at least see him for yourself...

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.540
I don't wanna see another martial artist!

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.640
And I hate to be a martial artist!

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.310
I wish I could be a normal girl...

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:02.960
I just want to fall in love with the person I love...

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:05.840
A normal girl...

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:07.950
I'm far from it...

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.840
Sanae-san is in there?

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.510
Yeah, but she's not opening the door.

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:17.590
Let's just call it a day.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.750
I'm sorry, Hikaru.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.200
It won't open, Hikaru.

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:24.270
Hikaru...

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.840
Did you see my kick?

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.480
Nice to meet you, Sanae-san.

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.900
I was chosen to be your fiancé.

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:42.700
I'm Hikaru.

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:49.860
No!!!

